# C8 anion addition: relax the H-BONDED PS rotamer to a true minimum.
#
# Seed = ps_rotamer_dih/job.017.xyz: the shortest O129...H132 on the C128-O130
# torsion scan (1.701 A, vs 3.845 A in ps_anion/). That scan located the
# five-membered O129...H132-O131-O130-C128 ring, but on the CONSTRAINED surface
# the H-bonded basin (D120 ~ +54 deg) sat ~28 kJ/mol ABOVE the un-H-bonded
# global minimum (-934.48106 at D120 -61.4, essentially ps_anion -934.48175).
#
# This job releases the torsion constraint and relaxes to a minimum, which is
# the decisive test: if O129...H132 is a real stabilising contact the geometry
# stays bonded and lands BELOW ps_anion; if not it falls back to the ps_anion
# conformer (H132...O129 ~3.8 A).
#
# Locked-composition optimised geometry + its own frequency in ONE job.
# Charge convention: QM region charge on the *xyzfile line; Charge_total = whole
# system. QM -1, host 0, total -1.
! QM/XTB B97-3c ddCOSMO(Water) Opt Freq TightOpt TightSCF

%QMMM
QMATOMS
	{55 58 61 64 120 121 122 123 124 125 126 127 128 129 130 131 132}
END
Charge_total -1
Mult_total 1
AutoFF_QM2_Method GFNFF
END

%geom
  MaxIter 500
end

%output jsonpropfile true end

%maxcore 4000

%pal
   nprocs 8
end

* xyzfile -1 1 job.xyz
